  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved working conditions of women in the labour market and reducing patterns of discrimination</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Jordan continues to advance equality and inclusion in the world of work through sustained efforts to promote fair, safe, and supportive employment conditions, including progress on areas such as non-discrimination, gender equality, care policies, and women&#x2019;s participation in leadership. Building on this momentum, the ILO works in close partnership with national constituents to further strengthen their capacity to design and implement forward-looking policies and practices that enhance decent work opportunities, with a strong focus on promoting inclusive labour markets that support women and persons with disabilities in accessing and thriving in quality employment.</narrative>
  </description>
